    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368490/extras/ce953c9566b8d048d46e86e9c96b0a85.poster.avif?t=1740303537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368490/extras/ce953c9566b8d048d46e86e9c96b0a85.webm?t=1740303537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Montaro 2 is a stealth game where you are a clever doggo, navigating through various locations such as shopping streets, residential areas, schools, stations, and public swimming pools to complete sneaky missions and steal interesting items. <br>Sneak into different scenes, use the environment and props to hide from store clerks, and accomplish mission objectives.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute Shiba Inu<br></li><li>Busy humans<br></li><li>Underwear<br></li><li>Woof!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368490/extras/842d68ab97a123f9d6fd368da1d4f0b5.poster.avif?t=1740303537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368490/extras/842d68ab97a123f9d6fd368da1d4f0b5.webm?t=1740303537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368490/extras/842d68ab97a123f9d6fd368da1d4f0b5.mp4?t=1740303537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
